      "title": "⚡ ITMS DASHBOARD NAVIGATION & SUBSYSTEM LINKAGES",
      "type": "text",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## 🔗 Inter-Dashboard Navigation Matrix\nNavigate to any ITMS dashboard with one click:\n\n* 🏠 **[01 - Master NOC Dashboard](/d/itms-master-noc/01-master-noc-dashboard)** — Global System Health Grid & Executive KPIs\n* ⚡ **[02 - Infrastructure Dashboard](/d/itms-infrastructure/02-infrastructure-dashboard)** — CPU, RAM, Disk, NGINX, Redis & PostgreSQL Metrics\n* 🛰️ **[03 - Realtime Dashboard](/d/itms-realtime/03-realtime-dashboard)** — Active Trips, 1Hz GPS Streams, WebSocket Fanout & Pub/Sub\n* 🚌 **[04 - Fleet & Operations Dashboard](/d/itms-fleet-ops/04-fleet-and-operations-dashboard)** — Bus/Driver Utilization, Route Stats & Student Waiting Flags\n* 💳 **[05 - Business Analytics Dashboard](/d/itms-business-analytics/05-business-analytics-dashboard)** — Payments, Revenue, Pass Subscriptions & Active Users\n* 🔒 **[06 - Security & Reliability Dashboard](/d/itms-security-reliability/06-security-and-reliability-dashboard)** — JWT Auth, Rate Limits, HTTP 4xx/5xx Errors & Disconnects\n\n---\n*ITMS Executive Dashboard Suite | Version 2.3 | Inter-Dashboard Linkages Enabled*\n"
      }
    }
